NET-TUTOS PROJECT SCOPE & ATTRIBUTION NOTICE
===============================================================================

1. Covered Ecosystem & Bounded Contexts
   This license governs the entirety of the NET-Tutos repository and its
   20-project .NET 10 / C# 14 distributed architecture (`NET-Tutos.slnx`),
   specifically including:
   - API Gateway Layer: `NET-Tutos.YarpGateway` (Microsoft YARP Reverse Proxy,
     Correlation ID Tracing & Rate Limiting).
   - Presentation Layer: `NET-Tutos.Web` (ASP.NET Core 10 MVC BFF, SignalR
     Real-Time Hubs, Bilingual VI/EN Geo-IP & SEO Engine) and
     `NET-Tutos.Mobile` (.NET MAUI 10 Cross-Platform Client).
   - CodeRunner Microservice (`NET-Tutos.CodeRunner.*`): Isolated Roslyn C#
     Compiler Sandbox, Security Guard & Multi-Test-Case Judge.
   - Gamification Microservice (`NET-Tutos.Gamification.*`): Streak Engine,
     XP Progression Curves, Badges & Leaderboard Services.
   - AiTutor Microservice (`NET-Tutos.AiTutor.*`): "Atus" AI Mentor Engine,
     Big-O Complexity Analyzer, Compiler Diagnostic Explainer, xUnit Test
     Generator & Technical Interview Simulator.
   - Shared BuildingBlocks: `NET-Tutos.Common` and `NET-Tutos.EventBus`
     (MassTransit & RabbitMQ Integration Events).
   - Documentation & Curriculum Assets: Single Source of Truth (`docs/01`–`09`,
     `docs/DESIGN.md`) and 101+ Bilingual C# / .NET Engineering Tutorials.

2. Brand & Attribution Preservation
   When redistributing, forking, or deploying derivative works of NET-Tutos
   (in source, container image, or binary form), you must retain the copyright
   notice above (`Copyright (c) 2026 Khải Võ & NET-Tutos Engineering`) in all
   copies and substantial portions of the Software.
